SCOPE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This package ships the equality-only OSS reference classifier for the
differential accessibility CI gate. It does NOT implement near-duplicate
matching; for production CI use the canonical engine. The package
depends on `@ariada-org/diff-schema` (workspace sibling) at runtime.

